  "details": "[Description:]\n\nWhen creating a new UI Theme (Color Pallete), a Share button is available. If you place a Share Pedestal before saving the Theme first, the Theme colors in the pedestal will be reset to default ones.\n\n[Reproduction:]\n\n1. Open VRC+ -> UI Themes.\n\n2. Click New Theme button.\n\n3. Change colors to custom ones.\n\n4. Click Share button.\n\n5. Place pedestal.\n\n6. Pedestal Theme has default colors.\n\n[Expected:]\n\nShared Theme pedestal should have the custom colors or the Share button shouldn't be available before saving the Theme first.",
